  "details": "The current menu system seems like it's trying too hard to be good for both desktop and VR and it end up feeling 'meh' for both. For an idea on what I'm on about take a look at the menus for Rec Room (see image). These menus have been designed specifically for use in VR and (unlike the current system) they feel very natural to navigate because you can just push a button with your finger. The menus in this game are in dire need of improvement and I believe this change would be a big step in the right direction.",
